<H1>Medium data</H1>
Search for medium no. = [469].
<HR>
Unless otherwise stated, sterilize media by autoclaving at 121&#176;C for 15 min.
<HR>
<P><B><FONT SIZE=3>469&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;TSA HEMIN MENADIONE MEDIUM</FONT></B></P>
Use Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=156">156</a> with 10.0 ml/L (final) hemin solution and 10.0 ml/L (final) menadione solution.   <br>
<I>Hemin solution:</I> <br>
Dissolve 50 mg hemin first in 1 ml of 1 N NaOH. Then adjust volume to 100 ml.  <br>
<I>Menadione solution:</I> <br>
Dissolve 5 mg menadione first in 1 ml of ethanol. Then adjust volume to 100 ml.       <br>
